  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup butter, divided",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour, or more as needed",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "3 tablespoons butter, softened",
    "0.75 cup milk",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup brown sugar",
    "1 tablespoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "4 ounces cream cheese, softened",
    "0.25 cup butter, softened",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather Ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Brush an 8-inch square baking dish with 1 tablespoon of the melted butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pFTxB4j-gUM49Qk8qQqwR7_AOug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-ingredients-9fc1093dcf90455185a8466006673e02.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dough: Whisk flour, white sugar, baking powder, and salt together in a large bowl. Work 3 tablespoons softened butter into flour mixture using your hands until butter is lentil-sized.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qXj_8LZm7XynADn3BoZmeu6snU0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-02-1-31fae56785bd455d8f72b8d336fbb8de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour milk into flour-butter mixture and stir with a rubber spatula until a soft dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WKAwfBRVjPgO4j7emmLXHBnGjBI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-03-bb8bc8e71d8a4497bfb9f3a5095b67df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a well-floured work surface and roll dough into a 10-inch square pan. Brush surface of dough with remaining 2 tablespoons melted butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o61qIzkooQcGWfaNYj_2KCksnMQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-04-4d5ea46a428e4d399aac596bfa33f444.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the filling: Whisk ¼ cup white sugar, brown sugar, and cinnamon together in a small bowl. Sprinkle 1 tablespoon cinnamon-sugar mixture in the bottom of the prepared baking dish. Sprinkle remaining cinnamon sugar over butter-brushed dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KVR6uncJYZNHsBwZRA3AsOjImGU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-05-98d5de525cab43aabb9efcbadeefc414.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough around filling to form a log; cut log into 9 rolls about 1-inch wide; place rolls, cut-side up, in the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Wabg76Jn2KuQVeQEJAXyZ69kdRM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-06-2-f489ee0437c14a62b5932d876fb9f6d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until rolls are puffed and lightly golden, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lWeQ68but6c30eVh0H-wkN0WRsw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-07-48974cf51139461d83571387d1ede464.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting: Beat confectioners' sugar, cream cheese, 1/4 cup softened butter, and vanilla extract together in a bowl until frosting is smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kY4Q1GThx_3cI-INm0MxXZly3CE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-08-d2f2359b6d0445e6ae9eff0821010506.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top hot cinnamon rolls with cream cheese frosting.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XLGb3sEECV-ties0xWrcGBa4XdI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-241917-quick-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-09-873f1df5a2f342d2be751ad399a0b95f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241917/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
